    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "星期一，她去学习，她去工作。星期二，她去学习，她去工作……",
      "traditional": "星期一，她去學習，她去工作。星期二，她去學習，她去工作……",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī tā qù xué xí tā qù gōng zuò xīng qī èr tā qù xué xí tā qù gōng zuò",
      "english": "On Mondays, she goes to study, and she goes to work. On Tuesdays, she goes to study, and she goes to work …"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
