      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "她没有时间玩，没有时间吃饭，没有时间睡觉。",
      "traditional": "她沒有時間玩，沒有時間吃飯，沒有時間睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "tā méi yǒu shí jiān wán méi yǒu shí jiān chī fàn méi yǒu shí jiān shuì jiào",
      "english": "She has no time to have fun, no time to eat, and no time to sleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "她要学习，她也要工作。",
      "traditional": "她要學習，她也要工作。",
      "pinyin": "tā yào xué xí tā yě yào gōng zuò",
      "english": "She has to study, and she also has to work."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，她很想家。",
